 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "text": "Scientists dated this shark to three hundred and ninety two years old.",
   "hook": true,
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "shark_okeanos.jpg",
    "z0": 1.4,
    "z1": 1.16,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.45
   },
   "gap": 0.18
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "text": "It is a Greenland shark. And that number came from its eye.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "shark_noaa.jpg",
    "z0": 1.12,
    "z1": 1.34,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.5
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "text": "The lens never changes after birth. So they radiocarbon dated it.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "shark_okeanos.jpg",
    "z0": 1.5,
    "z1": 1.24,
    "cx": 0.62,
    "cy": 0.42
   },
   "hero": {
    "at": 8,
    "lines": [
     "392 YEARS"
    ],
    "col": "a",
    "y": 390,
    "size": 158
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "text": "But here is the part nobody repeats. The real range was two hundred and seventy two, to five hundred and twelve.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "shark_noaa.jpg",
    "z0": 1.3,
    "z1": 1.1,
    "cx": 0.4,
    "cy": 0.5
   },
   "hero": {
    "at": 8,
    "lines": [
     "272 \u2013 512"
    ],
    "col": "a2",
    "y": 390,
    "size": 150
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "text": "We do not know how old it is, within two hundred and forty years.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "shark_okeanos.jpg",
    "z0": 1.16,
    "z1": 1.42,
    "cx": 0.35,
    "cy": 0.5
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "text": "It grows less than a centimetre a year, and swims slower than you walk.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "shark_noaa.jpg",
    "z0": 1.42,
    "z1": 1.18,
    "cx": 0.6,
    "cy": 0.48
   },
   "hero": {
    "at": 6,
    "lines": [
     "1 CM / YEAR"
    ],
    "col": "a",
    "y": 385,
    "size": 140
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "text": "And nearly all of them are going blind. A parasite clamps onto the eye, and feeds on it.",
